   9:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h **** /** @brief Non Volatile storage class for persistent settings on an external flash device.
  10:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  @author shensley
  11:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  * 
  12:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  Storage occupied by the struct will be one word larger than 
  13:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  the SettingStruct used. The extra word is used to store the
  14:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  *  state of the data, and whether it's been overwritten or not.
  15:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****  * 
