  58:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  The values in this class will be stored as the default
  59:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  for restoration to 'factory' settings.
  60:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *
  61:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  \param defaults should be a setting structure containing the default values.
